    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37179" root="كلح" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَحَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَحَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُلُوحٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُلَاحٌ</span>;
(S, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلكّح</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكلح</span></b> , (K,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكلوّح</span></b> ; (A;) <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>grinned,</i> or
<i>displayed his teeth,</i> (M, rendered in the S and K
by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَشَّرَ</span>), <i>frowning,</i> or <i>contracting his face,</i> or
<i>looking sternly, austerely,</i> or <i>morosely.</i> (S, M,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَحَ فِى وَجْهِهِ</span> <i>He frightened him;</i>
namely a child, and a madman. (A.)

